topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Classified Ad"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "A classified ad is an advertisement that is put in a newspaper by the seller."}, {"type": "text", "content": "They are put in groups (cars for sale, apartments for rent,  help wanted, etc.) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The seller writes a classified ad. They  pay for each word, and are often very brief. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "They use descriptive language to get the reader's attention."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "for rent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a house or apartment that you pay to the owner to live in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is that apartment for rent?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a classified ad."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spacious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a large amount of space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this spacious living room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fireplace"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a special place built in a room where a fire can be lit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This apartment even has a fireplace!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardwood floor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "flooring made from strong, heavy wood of certain trees"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer hardwood floors to carpet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "countertop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area on top of cupboards where items are put"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The kitchen has new countertops."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cabinet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place for storing things with doors and shelves"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like dark cabinets."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "convenient"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that is easy and doesn't cause any trouble"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apartment  is in a convenient location."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "secure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "protected from danger or harm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The unit is in a secure area."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Order of Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you describe a person, place or thing using more than one adjective, there is an order that you must follow.You use commas (,) between each adjective.</br>Look at the chart:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":7,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Opinion</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Size</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Shape</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Age</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Color</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Origin</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Material</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pretty\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"little\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"old\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Spanish\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lovely\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rectangular\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"red\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"glass\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I love that pretty, little, old, Spanish chair."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Vanessa thinks that lovely, rectangular, red, glass vase would look great in her new apartment."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Circle or copy words used to describe the the apartment."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use some of the terms you find to write your own ad for an apartment. (75 words)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your ad to a partner